{"id":"dormitorio","lemma":"dormitorio","pos":"noun","rank":1992,"glosses":["bedroom (a room in a house, apartment, hotel, or other dwelling where a bed is kept for sleeping)","dormitory"],"ipa":"/doɾmiˈtoɾjo/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"dormitorios"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/dc/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-dormitorio.wav","examples":[{"text":"Le mostré mi dormitorio.","en":"I showed her my room.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/453330"},{"text":"Mi casa tiene dos dormitorios.","en":"My house has two bedrooms.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/590335"},{"text":"¿Ya limpiaste tu dormitorio?","en":"Have you cleaned your room yet?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/524416"},{"text":"Vivimos en una casa con tres dormitorios.","en":"We live in a three-bedroom house.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/538113"},{"text":"Tom tiene su propio dormitorio.","en":"Tom has his own room.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/77898"}]}